{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Solace Paradox",
    "steam_appid": 2113420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113420/extras/a457eb0f6809f7eca2cef25bd5814286.avif?t=1749518519\" /></div><br><br>You find yourself in a peculiar magical laboratory, surrounded by mysterious objects and strange sensations. The only familiarities are the voices of your companions in your head, who you can curiously hear, but not see. Work together to explore your surroundings, solve mind-bending puzzles, and unravel the mystery of The Solace Paradox.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113420/extras/fe4ab6b912647fb74394ab361d2d261a.avif?t=1749518519\" /></div><br><br>The Solace Paradox is a 2-4 player cooperative first-person puzzle game designed for both veteran puzzle enthusiasts and casual sleuths alike, with a focus on communication and story rather than timers and skill-based challenges. Each of you finds yourself in a different variation of the game world containing puzzles, clues, lore, and items unique to you. <br><br>Help each other solve puzzles and discover the story by uncovering the similarities and differences between your worlds. There is no network connection between the games, so communication is key to unlocking the secrets of the island.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113420/extras/c0e5f92a3f8d12d5155a5d0829ff090c.avif?t=1749518519\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy a 2-4 player cooperative puzzle-solving adventure.<br></li><li>Conquer complex challenges in communication-based gameplay.<br></li><li>Accessible mechanics with an easy learning curve for new gamers.<br></li><li>Does not require a network connection; play remotely via your favorite voice app, or on separate devices in the same room.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113420/extras/a457eb0f6809f7eca2cef25bd5814286.avif?t=1749518519\" /></div><br><br>You find yourself in a peculiar magical laboratory, surrounded by mysterious objects and strange sensations. The only familiarities are the voices of your companions in your head, who you can curiously hear, but not see. Work together to explore your surroundings, solve mind-bending puzzles, and unravel the mystery of The Solace Paradox.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113420/extras/fe4ab6b912647fb74394ab361d2d261a.avif?t=1749518519\" /></div><br><br>The Solace Paradox is a 2-4 player cooperative first-person puzzle game designed for both veteran puzzle enthusiasts and casual sleuths alike, with a focus on communication and story rather than timers and skill-based challenges. Each of you finds yourself in a different variation of the game world containing puzzles, clues, lore, and items unique to you. <br><br>Help each other solve puzzles and discover the story by uncovering the similarities and differences between your worlds. There is no network connection between the games, so communication is key to unlocking the secrets of the island.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113420/extras/c0e5f92a3f8d12d5155a5d0829ff090c.avif?t=1749518519\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy a 2-4 player cooperative puzzle-solving adventure.<br></li><li>Conquer complex challenges in communication-based gameplay.<br></li><li>Accessible mechanics with an easy learning curve for new gamers.<br></li><li>Does not require a network connection; play remotely via your favorite voice app, or on separate devices in the same room.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Work together with your friends to explore a magical island, solve puzzles, and unlock the mystery of The Solace Paradox in this 2-4 player cooperative first-person puzzle adventure.",
